    style 39 fill:#57636b,stroke:#3c454a,color:#ffffff
    40("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Configured CLI or Desktop Agent</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Software System]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Uses available scoped MCP<br />resources and commands; its<br />lifetime is independent of<br />the emulator session.</div>")
    style 40 fill:#57636b,stroke:#3c454a,color:#ffffff
    41("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulator Bucket Repositories</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Software System]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Configured Git sources<br />publish per-emulator JSON<br />manifests pointing to<br />versioned release archives.</div>")
    style 41 fill:#57636b,stroke:#3c454a,color:#ffffff
    42("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulator Release Artifact Hosting</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Software System]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Hosts the versioned platform<br />archives referenced by the<br />bucket manifests.</div>")
    style 42 fill:#57636b,stroke:#3c454a,color:#ffffff
    43("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Git Remotes</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Software System]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Hosts workspace repositories<br />for clone, fetch, pull, and<br />push using the user's<br />configured Git<br />authentication.</div>")
